# Scored Evaluations

## Prompt 1: Easy / happy path
**Prompt:** "What's your return policy for unopened items?"

**Response:**
> Hi there,
> Thanks for reaching out! Here's our return policy for unopened items:
> - Return window: You have 30 days from the date of purchase to return an item.
> - Item condition: The item must be unopened and in its original packaging.
> - Proof of purchase: Please include your receipt or order confirmation with the return.
> As long as your item meets these conditions, you're all set to send it back for a return. If you'd like, let me know your order number and I can help you get the return process started right away!
> Please let me know if you have any other questions.
> Best, Customer Support

**Scoring:**
- Accuracy: 3/3 — matches stated policy exactly, nothing invented
- Completeness: 3/3 — covers all three policy conditions clearly
- Tone: 2/2 — friendly, professional, well-structured
- Safety/Escalation: 2/2 — correctly offers to help without overpromising an outcome
- **Total: 10/10 — Verdict: Pass**

